```css
/* ---------- Reset & Base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  background-color: #f4f5f7;
  color: #222;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

img {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
}

/* ---------- Layout ---------- */
.container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
}

.page-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
}

/* ---------- Grid ---------- */
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;      /* Mobile: 1 per row */
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

/* Tablet: 2 per row */
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

/* Desktop: 3 per row */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }
}

/* ---------- Card ---------- */
.product-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}

.product-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
}

/* ---------- Image ---------- */
.product-image {
  position: relative;
  aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #e9ecef;
}

.product-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

.product-card:hover .product-image img {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12px;
  left: 12px;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: #fff;
  background: #2563eb;
  border-radius: 999px;
}

.badge-sale {
  background: #dc2626;
}

/* ---------- Content ---------- */
.product-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex: 1;                 /* Lets footer align at bottom */
  padding: 1.25rem;
}

.product-category {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: #6b7280;
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
}

.product-title {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.product-description {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #4b5563;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

/* ---------- Footer ---------- */
.product-footer {
  margin-top: auto;        /* Pushes footer to the bottom of the card */
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.product-price {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #111;
}

.old-price {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #9ca3af;
  margin-left: 0.25rem;
}

/* ---------- Button ---------- */
.btn {
  padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #fff;
  background: #111827;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: #2563eb;
}

.btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #93c5fd;
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* ---------- Accessibility ---------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .product-card,
  .product-image img,
  .btn {
    transition: none;
  }

  .product-card:hover,
  .product-card:hover .product-image img {
    transform: none;
  }
}
```

## How It Works

| Screen width | Columns | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| < 640px (mobile) | 1 | `grid-template-columns: 1fr` |
| 640px – 1023px (tablet) | 2 | `repeat(2, 1fr)` |
| ≥ 1024px (desktop) | 3 | `repeat(3, 1fr)` |

**Key techniques:**

- **Mobile-first approach:** The default styles target small screens, and `min-width` media queries add columns as space allows.
- **Equal-height cards:** Grid stretches the cards in each row to the same height. Inside each card, `flex: 1` on the content and `margin-top: auto` on the footer keep the price and button aligned at the bottom, even when descriptions differ in length.
- **Consistent images:** `aspect-ratio: 3 / 2` with `object-fit: cover` keeps every image the same shape without distortion.
- **Accessibility:** The markup uses semantic `<article>` elements, alt text, and visible focus states, and animations are disabled for users who prefer reduced motion.

**Optional alternative:** If you'd rather not use breakpoints, this single line creates a fluid grid that fits as many cards as space allows:

```css
grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
```

However, the media query approach above guarantees exactly three columns on desktop and one on mobile.

