## styles.css

```css
/* ---------- Reset & base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f4f5;
  color: #222;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ---------- Header & footer ---------- */
.site-header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
}

.site-header h1 {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.site-header p {
  color: #666;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
}

.site-footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
  color: #888;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

/* ---------- Gallery grid ---------- */
.gallery {
  list-style: none;
  display: grid;
  /* Columns auto-fit; each is at least 220px wide, all equal width */
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1rem;
}

.gallery-item a {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  /* Forces every thumbnail to the same shape regardless of source image */
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #ddd;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.gallery-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;      /* crop to fill without distortion */
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

/* Caption overlay */
.caption {
  position: absolute;
  inset: auto 0 0 0;
  padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7));
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(10px);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* Hover / keyboard focus effects */
.gallery-item a:hover img,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible img {
  transform: scale(1.08);
}

.gallery-item a:hover .caption,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible .caption {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.gallery-item a:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #3b82f6;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Lightbox ---------- */
.lightbox {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 2rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease;
}

.lightbox:target {
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
}

.lightbox img {
  max-width: 100%;
  max-height: 90vh;
  border-radius: 6px;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}

.lightbox-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 1rem;
  right: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  opacity: 0.8;
}

.lightbox-close:hover,
.lightbox-close:focus-visible {
  opacity: 1;
}

/* ---------- Small screens ---------- */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .caption {
    opacity: 1;              /* no hover on touch devices */
    transform: none;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
}

/* Respect reduced-motion preferences */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
```

## How the even sizing works

| Technique | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))` | Creates equal-width columns that automatically wrap based on screen size |
| `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1` | Makes every thumbnail container a perfect square |
| `object-fit: cover` | Crops each image to fill its box without stretching, even when source images have different dimensions (note the sample images are deliberately mixed portrait/landscape) |

## Customization tips

- **Different thumbnail shape:** change `aspect-ratio` to `4 / 3` or `16 / 9`.
- **Bigger/smaller thumbnails:** adjust the `220px` in `minmax()`.
- **Fixed column count:** replace with `grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);`.
- **Your own photos:** swap the `picsum.photos` URLs for your image paths, ideally using smaller files for thumbnails and larger ones in the lightbox.

