/* ---------- Reset & base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

:root {
  --bg: #f5f5f4;
  --text: #1c1917;
  --muted: #78716c;
  --radius: 10px;
  --gap: 1rem;
  --thumb-min: 220px; /* minimum thumbnail width */
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ---------- Header & footer ---------- */
.site-header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
}

.site-header h1 {
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.site-header p {
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.site-footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}

/* ---------- Gallery grid ---------- */
main {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1rem;
}

.gallery {
  list-style: none;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(var(--thumb-min), 1fr));
  gap: var(--gap);
}

/* ---------- Thumbnails ---------- */
.gallery-item a {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;          /* every thumbnail is a perfect square */
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: #d6d3d1;          /* placeholder while images load */
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

.gallery-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;            /* crop to fill without distortion */
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

/* Caption overlay */
.caption {
  position: absolute;
  inset: auto 0 0 0;
  padding: 2rem 0.9rem 0.75rem;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), transparent);
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(10px);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* ---------- Hover & focus states ---------- */
.gallery-item a:hover,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.gallery-item a:hover img,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible img {
  transform: scale(1.06);
}

.gallery-item a:hover .caption,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible .caption {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.gallery-item a:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #2563eb;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* Show captions on touch devices (no hover) */
@media (hover: none) {
  .caption {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
}

/* ---------- Small screens ---------- */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  :root {
    --thumb-min: 140px;
    --gap: 0.6rem;
  }
}

/* Respect reduced-motion preferences */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
```

## How it works

| Technique | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))` | Fits as many columns as possible and stretches them evenly. No media queries are needed for the column count. |
| `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1` | Makes every thumbnail a square. Change it to `4 / 3` or `16 / 9` for rectangles. |
| `object-fit: cover` | Fills the frame and crops any overflow, so the sample landscape and portrait images don't look stretched. |
| `loading="lazy"` | Delays offscreen images until the user scrolls near them, which improves performance. |
| `:focus-visible` and `@media (hover: none)` | Keeps the gallery usable by keyboard and on touch devices. |

**Customizing:** adjust the `--thumb-min` and `--gap` variables in `:root` to control thumbnail size and spacing. Replace the Picsum URLs with your own images: the `<img>` holds the thumbnail, and the `<a href>` points to the full-size version.

