## How it works

| Technique | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))` | Fits as many columns as possible and stretches them equally, so the grid adapts to any screen width without media queries. |
| `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1` | Gives every thumbnail the same square shape. Change it to `4 / 3` or `16 / 9` for rectangles. |
