## CSS (`styles.css`)

```css
/* ---------- Reset & base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f4f6;
  color: #222;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ---------- Header & footer ---------- */
.site-header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
}

.site-header h1 {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.site-header p {
  color: #666;
}

.site-footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
  color: #888;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

/* ---------- Gallery grid ---------- */
.gallery {
  list-style: none;
  display: grid;
  /* Auto-fit as many 220px+ columns as will fit; each column stretches evenly */
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1rem;
}

/* ---------- Thumbnails ---------- */
.gallery-item a {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;      /* Every thumbnail is a perfect square */
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #ddd;          /* Placeholder while images load */
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

.gallery-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;         /* Crop to fill without distortion */
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

/* ---------- Captions ---------- */
.caption {
  position: absolute;
  inset: auto 0 0 0;
  padding: 0.75rem;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7));
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(100%);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* ---------- Hover / focus effects ---------- */
.gallery-item a:hover,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
}

.gallery-item a:hover img,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible img {
  transform: scale(1.08);
}

.gallery-item a:hover .caption,
.gallery-item a:focus-visible .caption {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.gallery-item a:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #4a90e2;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Small screens ---------- */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .site-header h1 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }

  /* Show captions on touch devices where hover isn't available */
  .caption {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
}

/* Respect users who prefer less motion */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
```

## How the even sizing works

| Technique | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))` | Creates equal-width columns that automatically adjust to screen size |
| `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1` | Forces every thumbnail container to be square (change to `4 / 3` or `16 / 9` if preferred) |
| `object-fit: cover` | Scales and crops each image to fill its box without stretching |
| `overflow: hidden` | Keeps the zoom-on-hover effect contained within the thumbnail |

The sample images intentionally use mixed dimensions (landscape, portrait, square) to demonstrate that they all render uniformly. Replace the `picsum.photos` URLs with your own image paths.

