## Key Features

| Feature | How it works |
|---|---|
| **Side-by-side layout** | CSS Grid with `repeat(3, 1fr)` creates three equal columns |
| **Featured plan** | The middle card has a colored border, larger padding, stronger shadow, and a "Most popular" badge |
| **Aligned buttons** | `flex-grow: 1` on the feature list pushes buttons to the bottom of each card |
| **Custom checkmarks** | Inline SVG in a `::before` pseudo-element, so no icon library is needed |
| **Responsive** | Cards stack vertically below 960px |
| **Accessible** | Semantic `<article>` elements, visible focus states, and reduced-motion support |
| **Easy theming** | Change `--color-primary` in `:root` to rebrand the whole section |

