## How it works

- **Even sizing:** `aspect-ratio: 4 / 3` on each item combined with `object-fit: cover` makes every thumbnail identical, even when the source images are portrait, landscape, or square.
- **Responsive columns:** `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))` adjusts the column count to the screen width automatically.
- **Lightbox:** Clicking a thumbnail jumps to the matching `#id`, and the `:target` selector displays the full-size image. Clicking anywhere on it returns to `#` and closes it.
- **Accessibility:** Captions also appear on keyboard focus, and images have `alt` text.

To use your own photos, replace the `src` URLs with your image paths. Ideally, use smaller thumbnail files in the grid and larger versions in the lightbox.

