## How it works

- **Even sizing:** Each `li` has a fixed `aspect-ratio`, and the image uses `object-fit: cover`, so photos of any shape are cropped to fit identically.
- **Responsive grid:** `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr))` adjusts the number of columns to the screen width automatically.
- **Lightbox:** Clicking a thumbnail jumps to a matching `:target` element that displays the full image. Clicking anywhere on it closes it.
- **Accessibility:** Images have alt text and keyboard focus styles.

