```css
/* ---------- Base / Reset ---------- */
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  background-color: #f4f5f7;
  color: #222;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ---------- Layout ---------- */
.container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
}

.page-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  font-size: 2rem;
}

/* ---------- Grid ---------- */
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;              /* 1 per row by default (mobile) */
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

/* Tablet: 2 per row */
@media (min-width: 600px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

/* Desktop: 3 per row */
@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
}

/* ---------- Card ---------- */
.product-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.product-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.product-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

.product-info {
  padding: 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.product-name {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.product-description {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #666;
  flex-grow: 1;                            /* pushes footer to bottom */
}

.product-footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 1rem;
}

.product-price {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1a7f37;
}

.add-to-cart {
  background: #2563eb;
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s ease;
}

.add-to-cart:hover {
  background: #1d4ed8;
}
```

## Key points

- **CSS Grid** with `grid-template-columns: 1fr` on mobile and `repeat(3, 1fr)` at the desktop breakpoint.
- **Mobile-first approach** — the default is 1 column, then media queries scale up (2 on tablet, 3 on desktop).
- `flex-grow: 1` on the description keeps prices/buttons aligned at the bottom of cards even with varying text lengths.
- Swap the placeholder image URLs for real product photos.

