```css
/* Section layout */
.pricing {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
  text-align: center;
}

.pricing-title {
  font-size: 2.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.pricing-subtitle {
  color: #6b7280;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

/* Card grid */
.pricing-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
  align-items: stretch;
}

/* Cards */
.plan-card {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}

.plan-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}

/* Featured card */
.plan-card.featured {
  border: 2px solid #4f46e5;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);
}

.badge {
  position: absolute;
  top: -14px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: #4f46e5;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* Typography */
.plan-name {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #111827;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.plan-price {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.amount {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #111827;
}

.period {
  color: #6b7280;
  font-size: 1rem;
}

/* Features list */
.plan-features {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 0 2rem;
  flex-grow: 1;
  text-align: left;
}

.plan-features li {
  padding: 0.5rem 0;
  color: #374151;
}

.plan-features li::before {
  content: "✓";
  color: #4f46e5;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-right: 0.6rem;
}

/* Buttons */
.plan-btn {
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #4f46e5;
  background: transparent;
  color: #4f46e5;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 1rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}

.plan-btn:hover {
  background: #eef2ff;
}

.plan-btn.primary {
  background: #4f46e5;
  color: #fff;
}

.plan-btn.primary:hover {
  background: #4338ca;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .pricing-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
}
```

## Key features

- **Featured card** — the middle "Pro" plan is highlighted with a border, shadow, and "Most Popular" badge
- **Equal heights** — `flex-grow: 1` on the feature list keeps buttons aligned at the bottom
- **Hover effect** — cards lift slightly on hover
- **Responsive** — stacks to a single column on screens under 900px

You can easily customize the accent color by swapping `#4f46e5` for your brand color.

