### Responsive Grid & Card Design

The grid uses CSS Grid with mobile-first breakpoints to switch from one column to two at 600px and three at 900px. Each card is a flex column, so the footer stays pinned to the bottom even when descriptions vary in length. The image area uses `aspect-ratio: 4 / 3` with `object-fit: cover` to keep a consistent shape. Hovering a card lifts it slightly with a soft shadow, and the button has a clear focus ring for keyboard users. The `prefers-reduced-motion` media query disables the lift animation for people who prefer less motion.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the placeholder image URLs (picsum.photos) with your own product photos, and update the titles, descriptions, and prices to match your actual catalog.

