This grid adapts smoothly from a single column on phones to three columns on larger screens, with each card keeping a consistent internal structure.

- **Breakpoint-based columns:** The grid starts as one column on mobile, becomes two columns at 640px, and three columns at 960px, using CSS Grid and media queries.
