### Responsive Grid & Card Design

This grid adapts smoothly from mobile to desktop, and each card is built to stay tidy and interactive.

- **Mobile-first breakpoints:** The grid starts as a single column on small screens, switches to two columns at 640px, and becomes three columns at 960px. This keeps the layout readable on any device.
- **Equal-height cards:** Each card uses flexbox with `flex: 1` on the body and `margin-top: auto` on the footer, so prices and buttons align at the bottom even when descriptions vary in length.
- **Hover and focus feedback:** Cards lift slightly with a soft shadow on hover, and all interactive elements show a clear focus ring for keyboard users.
- **Accessible motion:** A `prefers-reduced-motion` media query disables transitions and animations for users who prefer less movement.
