### Responsive Grid & Card Design

This grid adapts smoothly from mobile to desktop, and each card stays visually consistent.

- **Mobile-first breakpoints:** The grid starts as a single column, switches to two columns at 640px, and reaches three columns at 960px.
- **Equal-height cards:** Each card uses flexbox with `flex: 1` on the body and `margin-top: auto` on the footer, so buttons align at the bottom even when descriptions vary in length.
- **Subtle hover feedback:** Cards lift slightly and images zoom in on hover, while `prefers-reduced-motion` disables these effects for users who prefer less motion.
- **Consistent media area:** The `aspect-ratio: 4 / 3` on the image container keeps every product photo the same shape, avoiding layout shifts.
