### Responsive Grid & Card Design

The layout uses CSS Grid with a mobile-first approach, so cards stack neatly on small screens and expand into multiple columns as the viewport grows.

- **Mobile-first grid:** The `.product-grid` starts with a single column, then switches to two columns at 640px and three columns at 960px. This keeps the layout readable on phones while using wider screens efficiently.
- **Card structure:** Each card is a flex column with an image area, title, description, and a footer that stays pinned to the bottom. The `aspect-ratio: 4 / 3` on the media container keeps image proportions consistent across all cards.
- **Interactive feedback:** Hovering a card lifts it slightly and zooms the image, while the “Add to cart” button changes color. Focus-visible outlines and reduced-motion support make the grid more accessible.
- **Design tokens:** Colors, spacing, radius, and shadows are defined as CSS variables in `:root`, so you can adjust the look without hunting through the stylesheet.
