### Responsive Product Grid: Layout & Interaction

The grid adapts smoothly across screen sizes, and each card is built to keep content aligned and interactive.

- **Responsive columns:** The grid starts with one column on mobile, switches to two columns at 640px, and three columns at 960px, so cards stay readable without horizontal scrolling.
- **Card structure:** Each card uses a flex column layout. The image sits on top with a fixed 4:3 aspect ratio, while the body holds the title, description, price, and button.
- **Button alignment:** The "Add to cart" button uses `margin-top: auto`, which pushes it to the bottom of every card, keeping buttons aligned even when descriptions vary in length.
- **Hover and focus feedback:** Cards lift slightly and gain a deeper shadow on hover or keyboard focus, and the button changes background color on hover. A reduced-motion media query disables these animations for users who prefer less movement.
