### Responsive Grid & Card Interactions

Let's walk through the main pieces that make this grid work.

- **Three breakpoints for layout**: The grid starts as a single column on mobile, switches to two columns at 640px, and becomes three columns at 960px. This keeps the cards comfortable to read on any screen.
- **Card structure**: Each card uses flexbox to stack the image, title, description, and footer. The description has `flex: 1`, which pushes the price and button to the bottom so all cards align neatly.
- **Hover and focus feedback**: Cards lift slightly on hover, and the image zooms in gently. Buttons have a clear hover state and a visible focus ring for keyboard users.
- **Reduced motion support**: If the user has `prefers-reduced-motion` enabled, the hover animations are turned off to avoid discomfort.
---

**Optimization Tip:** The product images currently use picsum.photos placeholders. You can replace the `src` URLs with your own product image links, and update the titles, descriptions, and prices to match your actual catalog.

