### Responsive Grid & Card Design

This grid adapts smoothly from mobile to desktop, with cards that feel consistent and interactive.

- **Mobile-first breakpoints:** The grid starts as a single column, then switches to two columns at 640px and three columns at 960px. This keeps the layout readable on any screen size.
- **Card layout:** Each card uses flexbox to push the button to the bottom, so all cards in a row align neatly even when descriptions vary in length.
- **Visual feedback:** Hovering or focusing a card lifts it slightly with a stronger shadow. The button also has a hover color change and a subtle press effect.
- **Accessibility touches:** Focus outlines are visible on the button, and `prefers-reduced-motion` disables the lift and transition animations for users who prefer less motion.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the emoji placeholders and gradient backgrounds in the `.card__media` elements with actual product images, such as `<img>` tags, to make the cards production-ready.

