- **Image cropping:** `object-fit: cover` fills each tile without stretching, so photos of any aspect ratio stay visually consistent.
- **Caption overlay:** A gradient-backed label appears on hover, adding context without cluttering the default view.
- **Accessibility:** Focus outlines are visible, alt text describes each image, and reduced-motion preferences disable the zoom effect.
