### Plan Cards & Interaction Design

The three cards share a consistent structure, while the middle one gets extra visual weight to guide attention.

- **Three-column grid** keeps the plans side by side on desktop, with a single-column stack on smaller screens.
- **Featured card** uses a badge, stronger shadow, and a gradient background to stand out as the most popular option.
- **Hover effects** lift each card slightly and deepen the shadow, giving a subtle interactive feel.
- **Feature lists** use a checkmark icon before each item, making benefits easy to scan.
- **Call-to-action buttons** are pinned to the bottom of each card, so they align neatly even when descriptions vary in length.
- **Responsive behavior** collapses the grid to one column below 900px and respects reduced-motion preferences.
---

