### Pricing Card Layout & Interaction Details

This pricing section keeps the three plans easy to compare while giving the Pro plan a clear visual edge.

- **Three-column grid:** The cards sit side by side on desktop, with equal heights and a 24px gap. On screens narrower than 900px, they stack into a single column.
- **Featured Pro plan:** A purple border, soft gradient background, and a "Most popular" badge make the middle card stand out. Its call-to-action button also uses the accent color.
- **Hover and focus feedback:** Each card lifts slightly on hover with a deeper shadow. The CTA buttons change background on hover and show a visible focus ring for keyboard users.
- **Feature list styling:** Checkmark icons are generated with a CSS pseudo-element and an inline SVG, so no extra image files are needed.
- **Reduced motion support:** If the user prefers reduced motion, hover transforms and transitions are disabled automatically.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the plan names, prices, feature lists, and CTA link URLs with your own content. The accent color is controlled by the `--accent` variable in `:root`, so changing it updates the featured card and buttons.

