### Design Highlights of the Pricing Cards

The section leans on a clean, airy layout to keep plan comparison effortless, with a few intentional moves to guide the eye.

- **Three-up grid with a clear focal point:** The middle card uses a dark navy background and a slight upward lift, so it naturally draws attention without shouting. The “Most popular” pill badge adds a friendly nudge.
- **Themeable card tokens:** Each card defines its own CSS custom properties for background, text, checkmark, and button colors. The featured variant simply overrides those variables, keeping the markup clean and the styling consistent.
- **Consistent vertical rhythm:** Card heads, prices, and feature lists share a steady gap, while buttons are pinned to the bottom with `margin-top: auto` — so all three cards feel aligned even when feature counts differ.
- **Subtle motion and accessibility:** Hover lifts are small and smooth, and `prefers-reduced-motion` disables them for users who prefer less animation. Focus outlines are also kept visible for keyboard navigation.

