**Key points:**

- **Desktop:** `grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)` gives exactly 3 cards per row.
- **Tablet (≤900px):** drops to 2 columns.
- **Mobile (≤600px):** `grid-template-columns: 1fr` gives 1 card per row.
- Cards use `flex-direction: column` with `flex: 1` on the body so the price/button row aligns at the bottom even when descriptions differ in length.
- `aspect-ratio` on the image keeps all card images the same height without fixed pixel dimensions.

**Alternative (auto-responsive without media queries):**

```css
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
}
```

This version automatically fits as many ~280px columns as fit the container — 3 on wide screens, 1 on phones — though the exact column count depends on the container width rather than fixed breakpoints.

