**Split into two files** — move everything inside `<style>` into `styles.css` and link it with `<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">` in the `<head>`.

**Lightbox** — the `<a href="photos/1.jpg">` links are already hooks: add a small script that intercepts clicks and shows the full-size image in a modal overlay.

