/* ---------- Base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #12141a;
  color: #f2f3f5;
}

/* ---------- Header ---------- */
.gallery-header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
}

.gallery-header h1 {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.gallery-header p {
  margin: 0;
  color: #9aa0ab;
}

/* ---------- Grid: evenly sized thumbnails ---------- */
.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.gallery-item {
  margin: 0;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: #1e212a;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;              /* keeps every tile the same shape */
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.gallery-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;                 /* crops images to fill the tile evenly */
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

/* Caption overlay */
.gallery-item figcaption {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  padding: 2rem 0.9rem 0.8rem;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(8px);
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* Hover effects */
.gallery-item:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}

.gallery-item:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.08);
}

.gallery-item:hover figcaption {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

/* ---------- Responsive tweaks ---------- */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gallery-item figcaption {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    padding: 1.5rem 0.6rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
}
```

### Key techniques
| Goal | Solution |
|---|---|
| Evenly sized thumbnails | `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr))` + `aspect-ratio: 4/3` |
| Images cropped uniformly | `object-fit: cover` with `width/height: 100%` |
| Responsive without media-query column counts | `auto-fill` + `minmax()` (media query only tweaks density) |
| Smooth hover | `transform: scale()` on the image, caption overlay via gradient |

> **Note:** The `picsum.photos` URLs are placeholders — replace the `src` values with your own image paths. If your images have different dimensions, `object-fit: cover` keeps the grid perfectly uniform.

