*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
  background-color: #12141a;
  color: #f2f2f2;
}

/* ===== Header ===== */
.gallery-header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
}

.gallery-header h1 {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.gallery-header p {
  margin: 0;
  color: #9aa0ab;
}

/* ===== Grid Layout ===== */
.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  max-width: 1400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* ===== Thumbnail ===== */
.gallery-item {
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background-color: #1c1f27;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}

.gallery-item:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}

/* Fixed aspect ratio keeps every thumbnail the same size */
.gallery-item img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;      /* change to 1 / 1 for squares */
  object-fit: cover;         /* crops images to fill the box evenly */
  background-color: #23262f;
}

.gallery-item figcaption {
  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #d6d9e0;
  border-top: 1px solid #2a2e38;
}

/* ===== Responsive tweaks ===== */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gallery-item figcaption {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
}
```

**Key techniques for evenly sized thumbnails:**

- **`grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr))`** — creates a responsive grid where all columns are equal width.
- **`aspect-ratio: 4 / 3`** — gives every thumbnail the same height regardless of the source image dimensions.
- **`object-fit: cover`** — crops images to fill the box without distortion, so wide and tall photos look uniform.
- **`width: 100%`** — makes each image scale to its grid column.

Swap `aspect-ratio: 4 / 3` for `1 / 1` if you'd prefer square thumbnails.

