### Key techniques

| Goal | CSS used |
|---|---|
| Evenly sized tiles | `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1` on `.photo` (change to `4 / 3` or `16 / 9` for other shapes) |
| Images fill tile without distortion | `object-fit: cover` + `width/height: 100%` |
