### How it works
- **`grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))`** — creates as many equal-width columns as fit, so every tile is the same size.
- **`aspect-ratio: 1 / 1`** — forces each thumbnail frame to be a square.
- **`object-fit: cover`** — crops the image to fill the square without distortion (no stretching).
- **`loading="lazy"`** — improves performance on long galleries.

Tip: if you want a strict row count on large screens, swap the grid rule for `grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);` and adjust with media queries for tablet and mobile.

