### Key implementation notes

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Side-by-side layout** | CSS Grid with `grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)` and `align-items: stretch` so all cards match height |
| **Equal card heights** | Flex column on `.plan` + `margin-top: auto` on the CTA (or just letting the feature list grow) keeps buttons aligned |
| **Featured card** | `box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px` creates a 2px ring without affecting layout; absolutely positioned badge sits on the border |
| **Responsive** | Single-column stack below 900px, with the featured card moved to `order: -1` |
| **Accessibility** | Semantic `<section>`/`<article>`/`<h3>`, `aria-labelledby` on the section, real `<ul>` feature lists, and visible focus states can be added with `:focus-visible` |
| **Motion** | `prefers-reduced-motion` disables the hover transforms |

