  font-size: .9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-align: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s, transform .1s;
}

.btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }

.btn--primary {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
}
.btn--primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); border-color: var(--accent-dark); }

.btn--outline {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.btn--outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

.btn:focus-visible,
.toggle__btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .pricing__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    max-width: 26rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .plan--featured { order: -1; }   /* show the popular plan first on mobile */
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .plan { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
  .plan__amount { font-size: 2.5rem; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { transition: none !important; }
}
```

### Key points
- **Grid layout** — `repeat(3, 1fr)` keeps the three cards side by side; a single media query collapses them to one column on small screens.
- **Featured card** — accent border + floating "Most popular" badge, and it reorders to the top on mobile.
- **Equal-height cards** — cards are flex columns and the button uses `margin-top: auto`, so CTAs align across all three.
- **Accessible** — semantic `<section>`/`<article>`/`<ul>`, `aria-pressed` on the toggle, visible `:focus-visible` outlines, and reduced-motion support.

The monthly/yearly toggle is styled but static — add a small script to swap the `.plan__amount` values and toggle `.is-active` if you want it functional.

