## Key points

| Feature | How it's done |
|---|---|
| Side-by-side layout | CSS Grid `repeat(3, 1fr)` with `gap: 24px` |
| Highlighted middle card | `.plan--featured` uses a gradient border via `background-clip: border-box` |
| Responsive stacking | Media query at `900px` → single column, featured card moves to the top with `order: -1` |
| Accessibility | Semantic `<section>`/`<article>`/`<h2>`, `aria-labelledby`, real `<ul>` lists, visible focus states can be added with `:focus-visible` |
| Motion safety | `prefers-reduced-motion` disables transforms/transitions |

