### Key implementation notes

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| Side-by-side layout | CSS Grid `repeat(3, 1fr)` with `gap: 24px` |
| Equal card heights | Grid `align-items: stretch` + flex column on `.plan` |
| Highlighted middle card | Gradient border via double `background` trick + `translateY` on hover |
| Checkmarks | Pure CSS `::before` (circle) + `::after` (rotated check) — no images |
| Responsive | Single column below `900px`; featured card moves first with `order: -1` |
| Accessibility | Semantic `<section>` / `<article>` / `<h3>`, `aria` friendly contrast, `prefers-reduced-motion` support |

**Easy tweaks:**
- Change colors by editing the `:root` custom properties.
- Add a monthly/annual toggle by swapping the `.plan__amount` text via JS.
- For a light theme, set `--bg: #f7f8fc`, `--card-bg: #fff`, `--text: #14162b`, `--muted: #5c6180`.

