  border-color: #4338ca;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
}

.btn--ghost {
  background: #fff;
  color: #1f2933;
  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
}

.btn--ghost:hover {
  border-color: #4f46e5;
  color: #4f46e5;
  background: #f5f5ff;
}

/* ============ Responsive ============ */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .pricing__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .plan--featured {
    order: -1; /* show the popular plan first on mobile */
  }

  .plan__desc {
    min-height: 0;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .plan,
  .btn {
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

### Key points
- **Grid layout** (`repeat(3, 1fr)`) keeps the three cards side by side on desktop and stacks them on smaller screens.
- **Featured card** is visually elevated with a colored border, shadow, and a "Most popular" badge; on mobile it's reordered to appear first.
- **Checkmarks** are drawn purely with CSS (a circle `::before` plus a rotated border `::after`) — no images or icon fonts needed.
- **Accessibility**: semantic `<section>`/`<article>`/`<ul>` markup, sufficient color contrast, and a `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback.

