  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0.8rem 1.25rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
}

.plan__cta:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
}

.plan__cta:active {
  transform: translateY(1px);
}

.plan__cta--primary {
  background: var(--accent);
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}

.plan__cta--primary:hover {
  background: #7d6ef0;
  border-color: #7d6ef0;
}

.plan__cta:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #fff;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .pricing__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    max-width: 460px;
  }
  .plan--featured {
    transform: none;
    order: -1;                       /* show the popular plan first on mobile */
  }
  .plan--featured:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .plan,
  .plan__cta {
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

### Notes
- **Grid**: `repeat(3, 1fr)` keeps the three cards side by side; it collapses to a single column under 900px.
- **Equal-height cards**: the grid stretches items by default, and `margin-top: auto` on `.plan__cta` aligns all three buttons at the bottom.
- **Featured card**: scaled slightly, outlined with the accent color, and given a badge; it moves to the top on mobile via `order: -1`.
- **Accessibility**: semantic `<section>`/`<article>`/`<h3>` headings, `aria-labelledby` on the section, visible `:focus-visible` outlines, and `prefers-reduced-motion` support.

