    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pricing {
    padding: 48px 16px;
  }

  .pricing__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .card--featured {
    order: -1;
  }
}
```

**Key points:**
- `.pricing__grid` uses `grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)` for the side-by-side layout, collapsing to 2 columns at 900px and 1 column at 640px.
- The middle card gets a `.card--featured` modifier with a border accent and a floating badge.
- `align-items: start` keeps cards at their natural height instead of stretching, while `flex: 1` on the feature list pushes buttons to the bottom so they align across cards.

